=== Text #2 ===
> The fully furnished apartment (aprox. 50 m2) is situated on the second floor, the light windows and wooden floors, give the apartment a spacious and warm feel. It features a fully equipped kitchen (Dishwasher, Fridge, Freezer, Coffee Maker, Microwave Oven and Stove, dish washer, washing machine and dryer) and a bathroom with toilet.
There is a comfortable double bed in the bedroom, and you have excess to the balcony.
The Basic rent is 976 euro’ s per month.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

