=== Text #1 ===
> [Hi] loves! We cant wait to share[ this] inspire-board! It has Aw[eson]eness written all over it! We just can't help it - we thought these charteuse green and white are the[ perfect] palette season for your wedding![ So] brides - never think green as dull as you can always mix few tones of similar palette in a theme. Green are amongst the nicest (easy to pull it off) user friendly and flexible color. See how pretty these colors altogether? It creates a simple vintage theme; check out the rustic barn to a[ modern] loft.
WOW! I`m speechless![ Great] photos![][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

