=== Text #1 ===
> [This error] is from the HP Support Assistant.
It's possible that the Assistant is in trouble for some reason.
Sometimes the error is due to corruption.
You can try to troubleshoot it.
Go to[ this] link to download and install the[ latest] HP Support Assistant for your computer. Reinstall the Support Assistant - see if the error goes away.
1. Download the[ appropriate] ".exe" file to your PC by clicking the link[ below].
2. Run the downloaded file and[ follow] the onscreen instructions.
Control Panel -> Programs and Features -> Uninstall HPSA and just leave it off of your computer entirely.
[NOTE] that if you do remove the program you will not get automatic HP[ updates] and other benefits from the program.[ So] make sure to reinstall it.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

