=== Text #1 ===
> Google reader is dead to me. Or it will be on July 1, 2013.
[My] readers are numero uno. I WANT YOU TO STICK AROUND.[ So],[ here]'s how you can keep getting your Love & Loyally fix. Let's face it, there's nothing better than an co-dependent relationship.
Click "Import from Google Reader"
After the import is[ finished], all the blogs you[ follow] via Google Reader will be in your Bloglovin' feed. Yay!
BL is so much prettier than GR anyway.
Don't you worry... already made the switch. stupid google reader.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

